{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": [{"label": "dyn.analyze", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`analyze`** - one-shot GA + controllability + Gramian report.\n\n```flow\ndyn.analyze plant ga k1 k2 over rollout -> report { full }\n```\nBinds a `GAAnalysisReport` and assigns `k1`/`k2`.", "insertText": "dyn.analyze ${1:plant} ga ${2:k1} ${3:k2} over ${4:rollout} -> ${5:report} {\n    full\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "analyze", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`analyze`** - one-shot GA + controllability + Gramian report.\n\n```flow\ndyn.analyze plant ga k1 k2 over rollout -> report { full }\n```\nBinds a `GAAnalysisReport` and assigns `k1`/`k2`.", "insertText": "analyze ${1:plant} ga ${2:k1} ${3:k2} over ${4:rollout} -> ${5:report} {\n    full\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "gramian finite", "kind": 14, "detail": "sense Gramian binding", "documentation": "`gramian finite HZ trace -> name` / `gramian infinite HZ trace -> name` - bind controllability Gramian trace (sense block)."}, {"label": "gramian infinite", "kind": 14, "detail": "sense Gramian binding", "documentation": "`gramian finite HZ trace -> name` / `gramian infinite HZ trace -> name` - bind controllability Gramian trace (sense block)."}, {"label": "and", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "answer", "kind": 6, "detail": "f32", "documentation": "variable in `main`"}]}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": [{"label": "dynamics", "kind": 9, "detail": "dynamics namespace block", "documentation": "**`dynamics { ... }`** - namespace block for the dynamics DSL.\n\nBody uses bare `dsys` / `horizon` / `sense` / `ga evolve` / \u2026 lines.\nLine prefix alternative: `dyn.horizon \u2026` / `dynamics.sense on \u2026`.", "insertText": "dynamics {\n    $0\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.", "kind": 9, "detail": "dynamics prefix", "documentation": "**`dyn.`** - short namespace prefix for dynamics DSL constructs (`dyn.dsys`, `dyn.horizon`, `dyn.sense`, `dyn.ga`, `dyn.closed`, `dyn.analyze`, `dyn.wfc`).", "insertText": "dyn.", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.dsys", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`dsys`** - declare a linear plant (dynamics DSL).\n\n```flow\ndyn.dsys plant {\n    discrete   # or continuous\n    dt 0.1\n    n 2 m 1 p 1\n    A 1.0 0.1 0.0 1.0\n    B 0.0 0.1\n    C 1.0 0.0\n}\n```\nPrefixed form: `dyn.dsys` / `dynamics.dsys`. See docs/language/dynamics-dsl.md.", "insertText": "dyn.dsys ${1:plant} {\n    ${2|discrete,continuous|}\n    dt ${3:0.1}\n    n ${4:2} m ${5:1} p ${6:1}\n    A ${7:1.0 0.1 0.0 1.0}\n    B ${8:0.0 0.1}\n    C ${9:1.0 0.0}\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.horizon", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`horizon`** - name a finite or infinite analysis horizon.\n\n```flow\ndyn.horizon rollout finite 50\ndyn.horizon asymptotic infinite gamma 0.99\n```", "insertText": "dyn.horizon ${1:rollout} finite ${2:50}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.sense", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`sense on`** - open-loop analysis bindings.\n\n```flow\ndyn.sense on plant {\n    controllable -> plant_ok\n    spectral -> rho_open\n    gramian finite rollout trace -> wc_fin\n}\n```", "insertText": "dyn.sense on ${1:plant} {\n    controllable -> ${2:plant_ok}\n    spectral -> ${3:rho_open}\n    $0\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.ga evolve", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`ga evolve`** - genetic search for state-feedback gains.\n\n```flow\ndyn.ga evolve on plant over rollout -> k1 k2 {\n    population 12\n    generations 30\n    mutation 0.3\n}\n```", "insertText": "dyn.ga evolve on ${1:plant} over ${2:rollout} -> ${3:k1} ${4:k2} {\n    population ${5:12}\n    generations ${6:30}\n    mutation ${7:0.3}\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.closed", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`closed`** - certify closed-loop `A - B K`.\n\n```flow\ndyn.closed plant with k1 k2 {\n    spectral -> rho_cl\n    energy over rollout -> E_cl\n    stable -> stable_cl\n}\n```", "insertText": "dyn.closed ${1:plant} with ${2:k1} ${3:k2} {\n    spectral -> ${4:rho_cl}\n    energy over ${5:rollout} -> ${6:E_cl}\n    stable -> ${7:stable_cl}\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.analyze", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`analyze`** - one-shot GA + controllability + Gramian report.\n\n```flow\ndyn.analyze plant ga k1 k2 over rollout -> report { full }\n```\nBinds a `GAAnalysisReport` and assigns `k1`/`k2`.", "insertText": "dyn.analyze ${1:plant} ga ${2:k1} ${3:k2} over ${4:rollout} -> ${5:report} {\n    full\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dyn.wfc field", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`wfc field`** - Wave Function Collapse field (experimental coupling).\n\n```flow\ndyn.wfc field layout { size 4 4  tiles 3  seed 7 }\n```", "insertText": "dyn.wfc field ${1:layout} {\n    size ${2:4} ${3:4}\n    tiles ${4:3}\n    seed ${5:7}\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "dsys", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`dsys`** - declare a linear plant (dynamics DSL).\n\n```flow\ndyn.dsys plant {\n    discrete   # or continuous\n    dt 0.1\n    n 2 m 1 p 1\n    A 1.0 0.1 0.0 1.0\n    B 0.0 0.1\n    C 1.0 0.0\n}\n```\nPrefixed form: `dyn.dsys` / `dynamics.dsys`. See docs/language/dynamics-dsl.md.", "insertText": "dsys ${1:plant} {\n    discrete\n    dt 0.1\n    n 2 m 1 p 1\n    A 1.0 0.1 0.0 1.0\n    B 0.0 0.1\n    C 1.0 0.0\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "horizon", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`horizon`** - name a finite or infinite analysis horizon.\n\n```flow\ndyn.horizon rollout finite 50\ndyn.horizon asymptotic infinite gamma 0.99\n```", "insertText": "horizon ${1:rollout} finite ${2:50}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "sense on", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`sense on`** - open-loop analysis bindings.\n\n```flow\ndyn.sense on plant {\n    controllable -> plant_ok\n    spectral -> rho_open\n    gramian finite rollout trace -> wc_fin\n}\n```", "insertText": "sense on ${1:plant} {\n    controllable -> ${2:plant_ok}\n    spectral -> ${3:rho_open}\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "ga evolve", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`ga evolve`** - genetic search for state-feedback gains.\n\n```flow\ndyn.ga evolve on plant over rollout -> k1 k2 {\n    population 12\n    generations 30\n    mutation 0.3\n}\n```", "insertText": "ga evolve on ${1:plant} over ${2:rollout} -> ${3:k1} ${4:k2} {\n    population 12\n    generations 30\n    mutation 0.3\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "closed", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`closed`** - certify closed-loop `A - B K`.\n\n```flow\ndyn.closed plant with k1 k2 {\n    spectral -> rho_cl\n    energy over rollout -> E_cl\n    stable -> stable_cl\n}\n```", "insertText": "closed ${1:plant} with ${2:k1} ${3:k2} {\n    spectral -> ${4:rho_cl}\n    stable -> ${5:stable_cl}\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "analyze", "kind": 15, "detail": "dynamics DSL", "documentation": "**`analyze`** - one-shot GA + controllability + Gramian report.\n\n```flow\ndyn.analyze plant ga k1 k2 over rollout -> report { full }\n```\nBinds a `GAAnalysisReport` and assigns `k1`/`k2`.", "insertText": "analyze ${1:plant} ga ${2:k1} ${3:k2} over ${4:rollout} -> ${5:report} {\n    full\n}", "insertTextFormat": 2}, {"label": "controllable", "kind": 14, "detail": "sense binding", "documentation": "`controllable -> name` - bind `i32` 1 if rank(ctrb)==n (sense block)."}, {"label": "spectral", "kind": 14, "detail": "sense/closed binding", "documentation": "`spectral -> name` - bind spectral radius `f64` (sense/closed)."}, {"label": "gramian finite", "kind": 14, "detail": "sense Gramian binding", "documentation": "`gramian finite HZ trace -> name` / `gramian infinite HZ trace -> name` - bind controllability Gramian trace (sense block)."}, {"label": "gramian infinite", "kind": 14, "detail": "sense Gramian binding", "documentation": "`gramian finite HZ trace -> name` / `gramian infinite HZ trace -> name` - bind controllability Gramian trace (sense block)."}, {"label": "stable", "kind": 14, "detail": "closed-loop stability binding", "documentation": "`stable -> name` - bind `i32` 1 if closed-loop |\u03bb|_max < 1."}, {"label": "energy over", "kind": 14, "detail": "closed-loop energy binding", "documentation": "`energy over HZ -> name` - bind trajectory energy over a horizon (closed)."}, {"label": "population", "kind": 14, "detail": "GA setting", "documentation": "GA population size (default 8)."}, {"label": "generations", "kind": 14, "detail": "GA setting", "documentation": "GA generations (default 20, max 32)."}, {"label": "mutation", "kind": 14, "detail": "GA setting", "documentation": "GA mutation rate (default 0.3)."}, {"label": "discrete", "kind": 14, "detail": "dsys mode", "documentation": "Plant is discrete-time: `x[k+1] = A x[k] + B u[k]`."}, {"label": "continuous", "kind": 14, "detail": "dsys mode", "documentation": "Plant is continuous-time; Euler-discretized at `dt` before analysis."}, {"label": "full", "kind": 14, "detail": "analyze report mode", "documentation": ""}, {"label": "sort", "kind": 15, "detail": "Declarative ascending sort", "insertText": "${1:xs} |> sort", "insertTextFormat": 2, "documentation": "**`sort`** - declarative ordering (Phase 1).\n\n```flow\nxs |> sort\nxs |> sort descending\nxs |> sort by .score\nxs |> sortBy [desc .score, asc .name]\n```\nIn-place on `array<T, N>`. See docs/language/ordering.md."}, {"label": "sortBy", "kind": 15, "detail": "Multi-key declarative sort", "insertText": "${1:xs} |> sortBy [${2|asc,desc|} .${3:score}, ${4|asc,desc|} .${5:name}]", "insertTextFormat": 2, "documentation": "**`sortBy`** - multi-key ordering alias for `sort by [...]`.\n\n```flow\nxs |> sortBy [asc .score, asc .name]\n```"}, {"label": "sort by", "kind": 15, "detail": "Sort by one field", "insertText": "${1:xs} |> sort by .${2:field}", "insertTextFormat": 2, "documentation": "**`sort`** - declarative ordering (Phase 1).\n\n```flow\nxs |> sort\nxs |> sort descending\nxs |> sort by .score\nxs |> sortBy [desc .score, asc .name]\n```\nIn-place on `array<T, N>`. See docs/language/ordering.md."}, {"label": "sort descending", "kind": 15, "detail": "Declarative descending sort", "insertText": "${1:xs} |> sort descending", "insertTextFormat": 2, "documentation": "**`sort`** - declarative ordering (Phase 1).\n\n```flow\nxs |> sort\nxs |> sort descending\nxs |> sort by .score\nxs |> sortBy [desc .score, asc .name]\n```\nIn-place on `array<T, N>`. See docs/language/ordering.md."}, {"label": "asc", "kind": 15, "detail": "Ascending sort key", "insertText": "asc .${1:field}", "insertTextFormat": 2, "documentation": "`asc .field` - ascending key in a sort key list."}, {"label": "desc", "kind": 15, "detail": "Descending sort key", "insertText": "desc .${1:field}", "insertTextFormat": 2, "documentation": "`desc .field` - descending key in a sort key list."}, {"label": "unique", "kind": 14, "detail": "ordering", "documentation": "`sort unique` - sort then compact adjacent duplicates (prefix; N unchanged)."}, {"label": "entropy", "kind": 14, "detail": "ordering", "documentation": "`with entropy` / `with entropy(seed: N)` - allow randomized strategies (parsed; Phase 2)."}, {"label": "order", "kind": 14, "detail": "ordering", "documentation": "`order` - declarative ordering head (same family as `sort`)."}, {"label": "function", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "let", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "mut", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "return", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "if", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "else", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "elif", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "while", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "for", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "break", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "continue", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "parallel", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "in", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "step", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "to", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "struct", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "enum", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "trait", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "impl", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "effect", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "capability", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "handle", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "with", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "match", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "default", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "import", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "export", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "extern", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "const", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "module", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "test", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "self", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "array", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "ptr", "kind": 14, "detail": "keyword"}, {"label": "vec", "kind": 